{"3892180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ŽESTERGAME", "steam_appid": 3892180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sources of Misery have spread across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolve domestic disputes by carefully choosing your words and actions, explore a foreign world for its secrets, tunnel through the evil-meant mundane with your Pike, and prove your role as a Civil Servant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.webp?t=1765727276\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span>ŽESTERGAME is a highly stylized<strong> Nonlinear Exploration-Interaction Action-Adventure </strong>in which choices you make  spell the fate of foreign and strange misery-ridden areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/90ee0ec8723341da7d57b9c4f2f0e55f.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/90ee0ec8723341da7d57b9c4f2f0e55f.webm?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/90ee0ec8723341da7d57b9c4f2f0e55f.mp4?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.webp?t=1765727276\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span>Use an <strong>in-depth, no-take-backs dialogue system</strong> to leverage your <strong>trait points</strong> and divide your attention into selfishness or selflesness. <strong>Transfer items and ideas.</strong> Each interaction causes ripple effects through multiple chapters. Set the image of all Žesters before and after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/6365e51a81ca1a953395d11eef8cd017.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/6365e51a81ca1a953395d11eef8cd017.webm?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/6365e51a81ca1a953395d11eef8cd017.mp4?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.webp?t=1765727276\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span><strong>Fast-paced pike-n-slash</strong> <strong>combat</strong> will aid the screaming citizen! <strong>Pike your enemies</strong> and use them for civil good. <strong>Unlock</strong> strange tools and<strong> combo your movement </strong>for real justice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/4def89957a0027c95b639a5995d0ece4.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/4def89957a0027c95b639a5995d0ece4.webm?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/4def89957a0027c95b639a5995d0ece4.mp4?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.webp?t=1765727276\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/823e81b983d4117028be410e70c8b2d6.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span><strong>CLIMB EVERYTHING!</strong> Walls and ceilings lose their meaning; make your way to difficult places using a novel climbing system that'll see you hanging on for dear life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/d65ce304ea3ad751a0beaa5e9cb5a135.poster.avif?t=1765727276\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/d65ce304ea3ad751a0beaa5e9cb5a135.webm?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892180/extras/d65ce304ea3ad751a0beaa5e9cb5a135.mp4?t=1765727276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=